WEBVTT

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:18.240
I'll become the grim reaper again!

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:21.440
I'll drag them down into a real hell!

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:24.630
And this time, I'll save Nico and West!

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:26.970
Kiryu, I'll also fight.

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:28.860
Together again.

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:41.780
Lend me your strength.

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:48.310
Satisfy me!

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:11.120
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:16.620
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:21.090
Don't look back and keep going

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:26.930
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:31.900
There's no need to fear

00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:39.580
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:45.620
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:51.390
Streak to the infinite future

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:56.790
Dreams surpass their limits

00:01:57.060 --> 00:02:04.900
And will lead you to a bright place

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:36.870
Tag Duel
Kiryu/Yusei vs Lotten

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:06.270
Why?  I thought you let us join your group!

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:09.150
That's what Lotten said!  Right?

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:09.900
Yeah!

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:14.470
Did I really say that?

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:18.660
We don't need soldiers anymore.

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:22.490
We no longer have business rivals, 
and this town belongs to Lotten.

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:26.120
But there's no one to send 
to the mountains anymore.

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:29.450
Therefore, we can't survive 
unless we prey on each other.

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:46.040
Take out your Duel Disk and battle!

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:48.540
Help me!

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:52.610
This will eventually happen to you too!

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:59.230
I just have to win, right?

00:03:59.360 --> 00:04:02.280
I refuse to die!

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:03.450
You...

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:08.650
I won't die either!

00:04:14.340 --> 00:04:17.290
I can't send you to the mountain 
because you're too young.

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:19.860
So you'll be slaves in this town.

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:25.090
See how this town is really like!

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:26.290
No!

00:04:26.610 --> 00:04:29.240
Kiryu is going to save us!

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:31.080
He's going to defeat you!

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:36.420
Kiryu is dead, just like he wanted.

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:40.040
Kiryu is alive!

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.530
He has to be.

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:45.400
Stop having hope.

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:50.620
You'll live in despair, just like them.

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:00.560
We'll eventually end up like them.

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:04.380
That sound!

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:18.810
It can't be!

00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:38.160
I came back from the depths of hell.

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:40.820
Kiryu!

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:43.320
You're alive?

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:53.220
But this place is also hell.

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:55.730
You're fine with this?

00:05:55.890 --> 00:06:00.060
You're in hell, waiting to be sacrificed.

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:04.400
That's right!  I don't have to obey him!

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:07.940
Don't be getting any ideas.

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:10.370
You have nowhere to go.

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:15.190
Don't forget that your lives belong to me!

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:21.090
So if you're gone, their 
lives won't belong to anyone.

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:23.800
Stop talking nonsense!

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:25.820
We have hostages!

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:31.900
What's that sound?

00:06:41.390 --> 00:06:42.620
Nico!  West!

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:43.870
Yusei!

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:45.480
I won't let you!

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:53.040
Yusei!

00:06:54.650 --> 00:06:56.360
Too bad.

00:06:57.430 --> 00:07:00.770
I didn't think you were both alive.

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:05.520
Fine.  I'll finish you here.

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:10.040
I'll make sure to bury you this time!

00:07:10.310 --> 00:07:12.390
I'm looking forward to it.

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:17.690
Lotten, we'll defeat you and free this town!

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:21.000
Don't do it, Kiryu and Yusei!

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:22.280
Run away!

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:24.750
Don't worry about us!

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:30.050
Nico and West, I told you that 
I'll show you how I live.

00:07:30.430 --> 00:07:32.770
I promised to protect you.

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:36.880
This Disk belongs to the dead.

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:43.010
I've returned as the grim reaper while 
carrying their wishes in order to live!

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:44.480
Kiryu...

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:46.340
So don't give up!

00:07:46.450 --> 00:07:48.680
I promise to rescue you!

00:07:49.470 --> 00:07:51.690
Just like your father did!

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:56.270
That's why Kiryu is the leader of 
the legendary Team Satisfaction!

00:07:56.270 --> 00:07:57.440
Kiryu!

00:07:57.650 --> 00:08:01.560
You're gonna let him talk to you like that?

00:08:01.720 --> 00:08:04.250
I'll let him speak his last words.

00:08:04.570 --> 00:08:07.930
Good timing.  It's almost duel time.

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:15.430
I'll battle you both at the same 
time, but I get a small handicap.

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:19.350
I get ten cards for my first 
hand.  That's two people's worth.

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:23.400
Ten cards in his hand?  Is he planning to...

00:08:31.730 --> 00:08:35.940
He'll try to go first and defeat 
us with a One Turn Kill.

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:38.390
What will you do?

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:40.570
Kiryu, his plan is to-

00:08:41.010 --> 00:08:42.340
I don't mind.

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:44.300
Right.

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:46.330
If we're afraid to die, we'll lose.

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:51.530
Like Kiryu says, whoever shows 
how to live will win this match.

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:55.040
Whoever draws fastest goes first.

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:02.780
Kiryu...

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:05.460
Kiryu...  Yusei...

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:10.730
Duel!

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:21.300
Ten cards.

00:09:23.130 --> 00:09:25.780
I was the fastest.

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:35.500
Be careful, Kiryu!

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:36.460
Well...

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:41.490
Satisfy me!

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:55.160
My turn!

00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:58.900
I summon Gatling Ogre!

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:07.300
I load the bullets.

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:13.530
For every set spell or trap 
card that I send to the

00:10:13.530 --> 00:10:18.360
graveyard, Gatling Ogre's effect 
deals you 800 points of damage.

00:10:18.530 --> 00:10:21.000
He loaded all the bullets.  However...

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:28.120
Your monster's effect is 
negated until the End Phase!

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:33.040
I can use this card's effect 
to stop his One Turn Kill.

00:10:33.470 --> 00:10:35.240
Don't move, Yusei.

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:39.640
Bring it!

00:10:40.370 --> 00:10:43.010
You truly are the grim reaper.

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:47.020
Since you want to die so badly, 
I'll send you to hell again!

00:10:47.530 --> 00:10:48.720
Fire all bullets!

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:50.470
Gatling Fire!

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:58.150
Kiryu!

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:09.290
Kiryu!

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:12.330
Oh no!  Kiryu is...

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:13.750
Kiryu...

00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:22.780
My special One Turn Kill was successful.

00:11:22.960 --> 00:11:25.190
The grim reaper is-

00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:38.320
Impossible!

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:45.750
Why?  He has 0 life points!

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:51.430
I told you that I'm the grim reaper who 
has returned from the depths of hell.

00:11:51.820 --> 00:11:53.770
A grim reaper can't die.

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:02.190
A monster?

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:05.380
When effect damage reduces my life 
points to 0, I can discard all

00:12:05.380 --> 00:12:11.170
other cards in my hand to Special Summon 
Infernity Zero in defense position.

00:12:11.610 --> 00:12:17.660
When Infernity Zero is on the field, I 
don't lose even if I have 0 life points.

00:12:17.810 --> 00:12:22.810
But I get a Death Counter for every 
500 points of damage that I take.

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:27.130
When I have three counters, Infernity 
Zero is destroyed, and I lose.

00:12:27.130 --> 00:12:28.280
What?

00:12:28.280 --> 00:12:30.970
That's a crazy monster!

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:32.200
Kiryu!

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:40.380
The grim reaper.

00:12:40.670 --> 00:12:41.880
That's right.

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:46.100
I'll show you how a grim reaper lives!

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:48.270
Then show me.

00:12:48.480 --> 00:12:50.360
I still have bullets left.

00:12:50.570 --> 00:12:52.330
I reload all the bullets!

00:12:55.490 --> 00:12:58.300
Kiryu, I'm firing all the bullets at you!

00:12:58.900 --> 00:12:59.870
Fire!

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:08.290
If I take effect damage when 
I have no cards in my hand...

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:14.000
I can remove Infernity Doom Slinger in my 
graveyard from play to negate the damage.

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:18.000
Next, you get to choose Infernity 
Doom Slinger's effect.

00:13:18.140 --> 00:13:19.810
What?

00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:26.920
I'm going to draw the top card in my deck.

00:13:26.920 --> 00:13:32.290
If it's a monster card, you 
take damage equal to the effect

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:35.850
damage that I received plus the 
effect damage that was negated.

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:39.780
If it's not a monster card, I take damage

00:13:39.780 --> 00:13:43.220
equal to the effect damage 
that I received this turn.

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:49.360
If you decline to choose, you can't 
deal effect damage this turn.

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:50.860
What will you do?

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:55.640
If he draws a monster card, I'm finished.

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:59.010
If it's not a monster card, 
Gatling Ogre's effect

00:13:59.010 --> 00:14:03.430
damage will fire three Death 
Counters, and he'll lose.

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:09.080
Honestly, I forgot how many 
monster cards I put in my deck.

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:12.040
What will you do?

00:14:12.040 --> 00:14:17.200
Kiryu, you're leaving a life-or-death 
decision to luck again?

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:21.820
You're going to rely on luck?

00:14:22.050 --> 00:14:23.710
That's not like you, Kiryu!

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:26.040
Don't lose your temper.

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:27.830
It's only a duel.

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:29.170
I just need to win.

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:37.650
Due to battle royale rules, he 
can't attack on the first turn.

00:14:37.650 --> 00:14:41.200
That means I should just 
strike him on my next turn.

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:45.910
I'm clearly in the better position, so I 
don't have to take an all-or-nothing risk.

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:50.220
I decline to choose.

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:53.310
I end my turn.

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:56.280
You're afraid of the grim reaper?

00:14:56.470 --> 00:14:57.960
Say whatever you want.

00:14:57.960 --> 00:15:00.380
I won't enter your field.

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:02.510
I'll battle on my own field!

00:15:03.650 --> 00:15:04.960
My turn.

00:15:05.560 --> 00:15:09.240
Did he draw a monster card?

00:15:10.030 --> 00:15:11.590
Too bad.

00:15:11.940 --> 00:15:14.830
I set one card and end my turn.

00:15:15.190 --> 00:15:16.860
It wasn't a monster card.

00:15:16.860 --> 00:15:19.310
If I chose, I would have won.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:20.800
My turn!

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:23.910
I summon Justice Bringer!

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:31.940
I'll use this card on Lotten's 
next turn to negate Gatling Ogre.

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:35.220
I know you have Effect Veiler in your hand!

00:15:41.980 --> 00:15:44.880
I activate the trap card Pinpoint Shot.

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:49.870
If the card I said is in your hand, 
that card goes to the graveyard.

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:54.960
I set one card and end my turn.

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:58.690
I knew Lotten would be hard to beat.

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:02.570
He figured out my strategy after one duel.

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:04.290
My turn!

00:16:05.260 --> 00:16:09.510
I switch Gatling Ogre from attack 
position to defense position.

00:16:09.710 --> 00:16:13.320
I activate the Equip Spell 
Double Arms from my hand!

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:25.460
Gatling Ogre now deals double the damage!

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:28.380
Gatling Ogre's effect damage is doubled.

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:30.660
It will deal 1600 points of damage.

00:16:30.660 --> 00:16:34.430
You're gonna try to defeat me 
with a single blow?  Interesting.

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:37.850
Kiryu, take Gatling Ogre's effect!

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:39.120
Fire!

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:42.410
I flip over my trap card Dodge Roll!

00:16:43.130 --> 00:16:46.110
I take 0 damage once!

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:48.380
I still have bullets!  Fire!

00:16:50.430 --> 00:16:53.330
I activate my trap card Half Shield!

00:16:54.180 --> 00:16:58.330
Your monster's battle or 
effect damage is halved!

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:11.850
Death Counter...

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:17.860
Since Gatling Ogre's damage was halved, 
you took 800 points of damage.

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:22.550
When you have three Death 
Counters, your life is over!

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:26.610
It's fine.  Keep shooting at me.

00:17:26.610 --> 00:17:28.910
Send me to hell.

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:33.620
You still have bullets left.

00:17:34.470 --> 00:17:40.260
But even if he takes another bullet, 
he'll only gain one Death Counter.

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:44.310
Shoot me.

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:49.070
Does he really want to die in this duel?

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:53.250
No, he doesn't.

00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:57.080
Kiryu isn't leaving the 
life-or-death decision to luck.

00:17:57.700 --> 00:18:00.080
What will you do?

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:02.090
I see.

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:06.890
He's being a decoy so that 
I'll run out of bullets.

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:09.120
I'll save my bullets.

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:10.880
I end my turn!

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:16.640
Kiryu, you knew I would use 
Half Shield to help you.

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:18.860
You haven't given up on yourself.

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:20.680
Of course.

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:24.180
I carry the emotions of all 
the spirits in the mountain.

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:28.140
The regrets of the ones 
who died tragically...

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:31.460
The wishes of Nico and West's father...

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:33.310
Kiryu...

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:35.130
Kiryu...

00:18:35.450 --> 00:18:40.870
In the past, I led and battled 
for Team Satisfaction.

00:18:41.340 --> 00:18:44.180
But that was a lie.

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:51.050
I became a Dark Signer and learned 
that I was only battling for myself.

00:18:51.670 --> 00:18:57.310
I lost my friends and didn't 
know how I should live.

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:05.480
But since I'm now battling for people 
who believe in me, I feel alive.

00:19:05.480 --> 00:19:06.350
Kiryu...

00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:08.830
I'll no longer run away.

00:19:09.020 --> 00:19:13.020
I'll live and battle for 
those who believe in me.

00:19:13.020 --> 00:19:15.790
This is my new way of dueling!

00:19:16.310 --> 00:19:17.360
My turn!

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:21.430
I Special Summon Infernity Archfiend!

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:28.450
If I draw this card when I have no cards 
in my hand, I can Special Summon it.

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:36.190
When it's Special Summoned, I can add one 
Infernity monster in my deck to my hand!

00:19:36.740 --> 00:19:39.940
I summon the Infernity Mirage 
that I added to my hand!

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:46.330
When I have no cards in my 
hand, I can release this card

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:50.110
to Special Summon two Infernity 
monsters from my graveyard.

00:19:50.390 --> 00:19:54.830
I summon Infernity Beetle 
and Infernity Beast!

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:57.300
I activate Infernity Beetle's effect!

00:19:57.820 --> 00:20:01.010
By releasing Infernity 
Beetle, I can Special Summon

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:05.690
two Infernity Beetles from 
my deck, hand or graveyard!

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:16.190
This is how a grim reaper lives...

00:20:16.320 --> 00:20:17.790
Well done, Kiryu!

00:20:17.790 --> 00:20:22.100
If the four monsters' attacks succeed, 
Lotten will have 0 life points!

00:20:22.100 --> 00:20:25.540
Lotten, you're not allowed to lose!

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:28.330
That's why Kiryu is my hero!

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:29.220
Kiryu!

00:20:30.090 --> 00:20:33.280
Infernity Beetle attacks Gatling Ogre!

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:34.710
Beetle Shoot!

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:37.850
I flip over the trap card Back Attack Ambush!

00:20:37.850 --> 00:20:40.970
I can activate it when your monster attacks.

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:44.540
The Battle Phase ends, and I 
Special Summon Ambush Tokens in

00:20:44.540 --> 00:20:48.520
defense position equal to the number 
of your monsters in attack position!

00:20:50.260 --> 00:20:57.000
When I summon Ambush Tokens, you take 500 
points of damage for each one I release!

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:58.790
Each one deals 500 points of damage?

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:00.600
He'll have three Death Counters!

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:01.350
Kiryu!

00:21:01.550 --> 00:21:03.390
That's how to do it!

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:08.080
You're not gonna live!  
A grim reaper must die!

00:21:08.390 --> 00:21:10.320
You're finished, Kiryu!

00:21:13.310 --> 00:21:15.270
Burn the grim reaper to a crisp!

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:18.980
I activate Justice Bringer's effect!

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:21.130
Justice Slash!

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:27.420
When it's not my turn, Special Summoned 
monsters' effects are negated.

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:31.540
Yusei Fudo, how dare you!

00:21:32.280 --> 00:21:33.500
Yusei!

00:21:36.740 --> 00:21:37.870
Yusei...

00:21:38.800 --> 00:21:40.250
I won't let Kiryu die!

00:21:40.490 --> 00:21:42.720
Kiryu and I will defeat you!

00:22:08.410 --> 00:22:13.110
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:13.110 --> 00:22:18.120
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:18.380 --> 00:22:23.020
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:28.030
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:28.230 --> 00:22:32.900
The cruel god tests us

00:22:33.200 --> 00:22:39.840
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:39.840 --> 00:22:43.710
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:43.710 --> 00:22:49.550
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:49.710 --> 00:22:53.450
Bond is the proper word

00:22:53.450 --> 00:22:59.420
As we fight, we understand each other

00:22:59.420 --> 00:23:02.390
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:02.390 --> 00:23:04.630
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:04.630 --> 00:23:09.300
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:09.600 --> 00:23:12.170
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:12.170 --> 00:23:15.610
You want to party until the morning

00:23:15.610 --> 00:23:18.880
At our special place
